<title>USA: Norwest Corp sells $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Norwest Corp sells $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Norwest Corp was offered on Monday, according to sole manager UBS Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NORWEST CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	COUPON 6.75 PCT    MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES    ISS PRICE 99.20    FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3  YIELD 6.862 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P AA-MINUS	SPREAD 46 BPS	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
